            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty means “Price on request”.</source><target>Tukšs nozīmē „Cena pēc pieprasījuma“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Nosaukums</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Izkārtojums</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>A checklist for yes/no features, value pairs for details such as fees or quotas.</source><target>Kontrolsaraksts jā/nē funkcijām, vērtību pāri detalizētai informācijai, piemēram, maksām vai kvotām.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.list" approved="yes"><source>Checklist</source><target>Kontrolsaraksts</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.pairs" approved="yes"><source>Value pairs</source><target>Vērtību pāri</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard" approved="yes"><source>Show on cards</source><target>Rādīt kartītēs</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard.hint" approved="yes"><source>Some groups belong in the comparison table only and would overload the card.</source><target>Dažas grupas pieder tikai salīdzināšanas tabulai un pārslogotu kartīti.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Show in comparison table</source><target>Rādīt salīdzināšanas tabulā</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the group is left out of the comparison table.</source><target>Neatzīmējot, grupa netiek iekļauta salīdzināšanas tabulā.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funkcijas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Nosaukums</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType" approved="yes"><source>Value type</source><target>Vērtības veids</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.hint" approved="yes"><source>Determines how the cell looks in the comparison table.</source><target>Nosaka, kā šūna izskatās salīdzināšanas tabulā.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.check" approved="yes"><source>Check or dash</source><target>Atzīme vai svītra</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.number" approved="yes"><source>Number</source><target>Skaitlis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.text" approved="yes"><source>Text</source><target>Teksts</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.percent" approved="yes"><source>Percent</source><target>Procenti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit" approved="yes"><source>Unit</source><target>Mērvienība</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown after the value, e.g. “GB” or “users”.</source><target>Tiek rādīta pēc vērtības, piem., „GB“ vai „lietotāji“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote" approved="yes"><source>Footnote</source><target>Zemsvītras piezīme</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown in small print after the title in the comparison table.</source><target>Tiek rādīta sīkā drukā pēc nosaukuma salīdzināšanas tabulā.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Funkcija</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included" approved="yes"><source>Included</source><target>Iekļauts</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Attiecas uz funkcijām ar veidu „Atzīme vai svītra“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Vērtība</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>Skaitlim, tekstam un procentiem. Piem., „neierobežots“, „līdz 48“ vai „2.1“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Cenu tabula</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Cenu tabula</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table.hint" approved="yes"><source>The record holding plans and features. The same table can appear on several pages in different layouts.</source><target>Ieraksts, kurā ir plāni un funkcijas. Viena un tā pati tabula var parādīties vairākās lapās ar dažādiem izkārtojumiem.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Izkārtojums</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Plānu kartītes dažiem plāniem, kompaktas rindas sākot no aptuveni pieciem, salīdzināšanas tabula daudzām funkcijām.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Plānu kartītes</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Salīdzināšanas tabula</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Kartītes ar funkciju grupām</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Kompaktas rindas</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Kartītes ar izvēršamu informāciju</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Rādīt arī salīdzināšanas tabulu</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Salīdzināšanas tabula pēc tam parādās zem izvēlētā izkārtojuma.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Salīdzināšanas tabula sakļauta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Salīdzināšanas tabula atveras tikai pēc klikšķa — lapu padara mierīgu ar daudzām funkcijām.</target></trans-unit>
